WEBVTT

00:07.901 --> 00:13.661
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.161 --> 00:19.751
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.791 --> 00:28.341
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.341 --> 00:30.211
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.591 --> 00:34.141
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.471 --> 00:37.971
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.471 --> 00:40.811
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.811 --> 00:45.561
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.691 --> 00:48.901
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.861 --> 00:51.861
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.411 --> 01:01.121
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.451 --> 01:03.461
...with you.
futaride

01:04.461 --> 01:10.171
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.841 --> 01:16.261
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.471 --> 01:24.771
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.771 --> 01:26.601
...is important.
daiji daiji

02:05.382 --> 02:10.342
Affection...

02:18.472 --> 02:20.222
What do you want?

02:20.222 --> 02:21.522
Let's go there.

02:23.692 --> 02:25.692
Here, go "Ah~n".

02:28.022 --> 02:30.362
Oh, you ate my finger!

02:30.362 --> 02:32.492
I'm not letting go of it!

02:33.202 --> 02:35.072
What's up with this place today?

02:35.072 --> 02:36.282
Is it couple's day?

02:38.742 --> 02:40.162
Megu-chan!

02:40.162 --> 02:40.992
Hey.

02:40.992 --> 02:42.752
Ayano!

02:42.752 --> 02:44.002
Takumi-kun...

02:46.541 --> 02:48.382
It's been a while.

02:49.592 --> 02:51.882
Weren't you taking a break?

02:51.882 --> 02:54.672
I had some business with the club.

02:54.672 --> 02:56.222
Are you getting enough credits?

02:56.642 --> 02:59.552
I stocked up a lot in my freshman year.

03:00.602 --> 03:03.522
But we miss you, Megu-chan.

03:03.522 --> 03:04.482
Right?

03:04.482 --> 03:06.732
Yeah, the noisy girl.

03:06.732 --> 03:09.312
Jeez, Takumi-kun!

03:09.732 --> 03:14.652
I'm sure you're enjoying being in love with each other.

03:14.652 --> 03:17.242
Oh, come on, Megu-chan!

03:17.242 --> 03:20.702
You're so much more in love than us.

03:24.702 --> 03:25.502
Sorry...

03:27.041 --> 03:28.832
What are you talking about?

03:28.832 --> 03:31.342
We're not that close.

03:31.342 --> 03:32.592
Megu-chan...

03:35.402 --> 03:39.762
Eternal Love Story

03:42.102 --> 03:44.312
I'll follow you.

03:44.562 --> 03:46.942
Don't you care what happens to you?

03:46.942 --> 03:50.152
I don't care, as long as I'm with you!

04:02.952 --> 04:05.202
I believe in you!

04:24.012 --> 04:27.682
Don't fight over it.

04:27.682 --> 04:29.522
Here, listen to me.

04:30.022 --> 04:33.272
The taiyaki is filled with bean paste all the way to the tail,

04:33.272 --> 04:35.732
so it won't make any difference which half you get.

04:35.732 --> 04:38.402
So let's split it nicely.

04:39.902 --> 04:40.912
I want the head!

04:40.992 --> 04:43.202
I want the head!

04:43.202 --> 04:44.332
It's no good.

04:46.792 --> 04:49.371
Thank you, sir.

04:49.371 --> 04:51.252
Don't fight with each other.

04:51.252 --> 04:52.172
Okay!

04:52.172 --> 04:54.422
Don't drop them!

04:54.422 --> 04:56.712
You're so nice, sir.

04:56.712 --> 05:01.012
Actually, you're spoiling them.

05:01.012 --> 05:03.762
Momono-san?! Since when...

05:03.762 --> 05:05.972
Oh, can I have a taiyaki?

05:05.972 --> 05:08.062
Coming right up.

05:08.812 --> 05:12.352
See, you could do this.

05:12.352 --> 05:14.152
I see.

05:14.442 --> 05:16.192
I didn't see that.

05:18.032 --> 05:20.202
You're so dull.

05:20.532 --> 05:23.112
But they were happy,

05:23.112 --> 05:27.122
so it's okay.

05:27.992 --> 05:31.872
Well, I like that side of you.

05:34.292 --> 05:35.632
Hey, Shiratori-kun.

05:35.962 --> 05:37.052
Yes?

05:37.052 --> 05:39.632
Are you free tomorrow since its Sunday?

05:39.632 --> 05:42.512
Yes, I don't really have any plans.

05:43.972 --> 05:47.142
Then can you go out with me?

05:47.762 --> 05:49.352
Me?

05:49.352 --> 05:50.312
Yeah!

05:50.312 --> 05:51.022
Is it okay?

05:51.352 --> 05:54.062
Well, sure.

05:56.982 --> 05:58.942
OK, then it's a deal!

05:58.942 --> 06:00.612
It's a promise.

06:00.612 --> 06:01.282
Sure...

06:01.862 --> 06:03.412
Don't forget.

06:03.412 --> 06:04.992
I'll be looking forward to it.

06:06.992 --> 06:08.662
What was that about?

06:08.662 --> 06:10.252
Shiratori-san.

06:11.002 --> 06:12.292
Kozue-chan.

06:13.122 --> 06:15.212
Did you buy the taiyaki?

06:15.212 --> 06:16.792
Oh, I'm about to buy them.

06:16.792 --> 06:18.292
Sir,

06:18.292 --> 06:18.632
Taiyaki Sold Out

06:18.632 --> 06:21.712
I'm sorry, but that was the last one.
Taiyaki Sold Out

06:21.712 --> 06:22.052
Taiyaki Sold Out

06:42.242 --> 06:43.532
It's already time.

06:43.532 --> 06:44.862
I'd better hurry.

06:45.782 --> 06:49.332
Anyway, I wonder what the deal is today?

06:49.871 --> 06:51.452
I didn't hear anything.

06:52.452 --> 06:53.252
Yes?

06:54.792 --> 06:56.002
Yes...

06:56.002 --> 06:56.542
Oh?

06:57.462 --> 06:58.542
Good morning!

06:58.542 --> 06:59.752
Are you ready?

07:00.712 --> 07:03.212
Um, who might you be?

07:03.212 --> 07:04.222
It's me!

07:04.222 --> 07:05.432
You see?

07:05.432 --> 07:07.012
Momono-san?

07:07.012 --> 07:08.342
Let's go.

07:08.342 --> 07:09.682
Yes...

07:10.892 --> 07:13.852
Momono-san, where are your glasses?

07:13.852 --> 07:16.392
Oh, I'm wearing contacts.

07:16.392 --> 07:19.232
I usually wear glasses because contacts make my eyes tired.

07:20.942 --> 07:23.862
Well, you know, we're going on a date today.

07:23.862 --> 07:25.112
A date?!

07:25.112 --> 07:26.782
So I wanted to look good.

07:27.072 --> 07:28.072
Why?!

07:28.072 --> 07:29.162
I told you the other day!

07:29.162 --> 07:32.292
When a man and a woman go out together, that's a date.

07:33.162 --> 07:35.002
This isn't good!

07:35.002 --> 07:37.371
It's okay, it's okay.

07:37.371 --> 07:40.382
I already have permission from Kozue-chan.

07:40.382 --> 07:40.922
Right?

07:41.342 --> 07:41.962
Yes.

07:41.962 --> 07:43.382
Good morning.

07:43.382 --> 07:45.552
Kozue-chan!

07:45.552 --> 07:47.722
I'll be borrowing Shiratori-kun for a bit.

07:47.722 --> 07:49.932
Yes, take good care of him.

07:50.262 --> 07:51.932
I'm happy.

07:53.392 --> 07:58.942
I'm happy to see that you're getting close enough to go out together with other residents.

07:59.482 --> 08:01.812
Oh, I guess.

08:02.232 --> 08:03.652
I'm happy, too.

08:03.652 --> 08:04.362
Yes!

08:06.952 --> 08:08.612
Have a good day.

08:09.032 --> 08:15.292
To Kozue-chan, Momono-san and I going out together means nothing.

08:15.292 --> 08:17.332
It's a bit disappointing.

08:17.332 --> 08:18.752
Try it today.

08:18.752 --> 08:20.712
Let's take a break.

08:21.832 --> 08:24.342
There are so many people...

08:24.342 --> 08:26.172
So, where are we going?

08:26.172 --> 08:29.592
Well, there are so many places I want to go.

08:30.262 --> 08:32.722
But let's just have fun.

08:33.352 --> 08:35.602
It's all on me today.

08:41.521 --> 08:42.902
What the heck?!

08:54.202 --> 08:55.162
Hey, check these out!

08:55.662 --> 08:57.292
See, see?

08:57.292 --> 09:01.292
Momono-san is really cute today.

09:02.792 --> 09:03.712
But...

09:04.922 --> 09:06.212
But...

09:06.212 --> 09:09.632
What the heck is she plotting?

09:10.932 --> 09:12.342
What's wrong?

09:12.342 --> 09:14.602
Oh, nothing!

09:14.602 --> 09:16.102
Let's go to the next place.

09:17.222 --> 09:19.522
Here, it's over here!

09:19.892 --> 09:21.482
Momono-san is...

09:21.482 --> 09:22.732
Hurry up!

09:23.022 --> 09:26.112
...actually really good looking.

09:32.492 --> 09:34.032
Ta-da!

09:35.412 --> 09:36.242
What do you think?

09:37.372 --> 09:39.662
I think they're great!

09:39.792 --> 09:42.292
You're not looking.

09:44.212 --> 09:47.132
What's Momono-san's purpose?

09:47.752 --> 09:52.842
Do we look like we're dating, too?

09:54.222 --> 09:56.682
Is Momono-san okay with that?

09:58.852 --> 10:00.062
Do you want a french fry?

10:00.682 --> 10:02.442
No thanks.

10:09.942 --> 10:12.282
Can you leave them alone?

10:12.282 --> 10:13.992
Who?

10:13.992 --> 10:15.912
I mean Momono.

10:15.912 --> 10:19.792
I think she's pumped about getting Shiratori's attention.

10:19.792 --> 10:21.622
Momo-san is?

10:22.162 --> 10:23.582
No way.

10:23.582 --> 10:26.252
You never know.

10:26.252 --> 10:28.462
They're a man and a woman, too.

10:28.462 --> 10:31.342
If that happens, that happens.

10:31.342 --> 10:35.392
Hey, hey, then what happens to Kozue?

10:35.392 --> 10:37.302
If that happens,

10:38.012 --> 10:42.432
I'll make Kozue-chan happy.

10:45.022 --> 10:47.732
Maybe we can still catch it.

10:47.732 --> 10:51.692
I wonder if Momono-san has a boyfriend.

10:52.782 --> 10:54.202
All right, let's go.

10:54.202 --> 10:56.742
Aiya, you two.

10:57.662 --> 11:03.712
I'm sorry to disturb your good time, but I see some bad luck befalling you.

11:03.712 --> 11:04.932
Bad luck?

11:04.932 --> 11:07.632
Ahh... I don't believe in fortunes.

11:08.542 --> 11:10.252
Wait!

11:10.252 --> 11:12.132
You're my first customer in two days!

11:12.132 --> 11:14.092
I won't let you get away!

11:14.092 --> 11:14.882
Let's go.

11:17.512 --> 11:19.052
Wait!

11:26.772 --> 11:29.732
That fortune teller was so persistent.

11:29.732 --> 11:31.482
I know.

11:31.902 --> 11:35.492
Why won't she tell her own fortune before telling other peoples'?

11:35.492 --> 11:37.322
Really.

11:58.592 --> 11:59.842
That's right.

11:59.842 --> 12:04.142
Today, Shiratori-san is out with Momono-san.

12:21.012 --> 12:21.742
Jingi Naki Battle

12:21.742 --> 12:24.012
Jingi Naki Battle?
Jingi Naki Battle

12:24.452 --> 12:25.372
Yup.

12:25.372 --> 12:27.582
Shiratori-san, do you not like movies?

12:27.582 --> 12:29.632
Yeah, I do.

12:29.632 --> 12:31.422
That's good.

12:31.422 --> 12:34.092
It's more fun to watch movies with people who like them.

12:34.922 --> 12:37.092
Do you like movies, too?

12:38.382 --> 12:41.352
It's more like an obligation.

12:41.352 --> 12:43.932
But I guess I like them.

12:45.472 --> 12:45.982
Oh,

12:47.182 --> 12:49.602
can I sit on that side?

12:49.602 --> 12:51.312
Sure.

12:52.112 --> 12:53.272
I'm sorry.

12:53.272 --> 12:54.612
It's like a habit.

12:59.532 --> 13:02.702
Kojima Cinema Scramble!

13:03.912 --> 13:06.292
The 5th of every month is Kojima day.

13:06.292 --> 13:08.412
Tickets are 500 yen on those days.

13:14.172 --> 13:15.092
That's it!

13:26.522 --> 13:27.682
What now?

13:27.682 --> 13:30.352
I can't concentrate on the movie.

15:25.472 --> 15:28.262
Com on, don't sulk.

15:28.262 --> 15:30.562
You're going to make your dream come true.

15:31.222 --> 15:34.232
Don't come back until you've mastered it.

15:34.772 --> 15:35.312
See ya.

16:00.882 --> 16:03.012
M-Momono-san?

16:07.932 --> 16:11.182
Contacts still wear out my eyes.

16:11.182 --> 16:12.142
Momono-san...

16:15.232 --> 16:16.142
All good.

16:18.102 --> 16:18.852
I'm sorry!

16:19.942 --> 16:21.942
I was testing something today.

16:23.022 --> 16:24.032
I'm really sorry!

16:24.032 --> 16:26.322
Wha... Testing?

16:27.362 --> 16:30.412
I see, I was being tested.

16:30.412 --> 16:31.412
I see.

16:32.492 --> 16:36.332
N-No, I was testing myself.

16:39.342 --> 16:43.422
I went through a lot while I was in junior high.

16:43.422 --> 16:45.632
Well, that aside...

16:46.422 --> 16:51.602
Anyway, I'm still dating a guy that I met back then.

16:54.062 --> 16:57.392
I-I wasn't trying to hide it until now!

16:57.392 --> 16:58.142
Right.

16:59.312 --> 17:03.272
But he's now in a very far away place...

17:03.272 --> 17:05.362
...studying film making.

17:06.072 --> 17:09.322
It's been a while, and we're only writing to each other.

17:10.112 --> 17:12.282
And recently, even those are...

17:12.282 --> 17:13.412
...not coming.

17:13.412 --> 17:14.242
Letters?

17:20.462 --> 17:22.842
Maybe she's in a long distance relationship!

17:24.132 --> 17:27.422
So it was hard not being able to see him.

17:27.972 --> 17:30.802
But it's not his fault.

17:30.802 --> 17:34.012
When he was getting ready, he asked me if I'd like to come along.

17:34.852 --> 17:39.022
But I didn't want to restrain him.

17:39.322 --> 17:41.732
Y-You're thinking that this's all silly, aren't you?

17:41.732 --> 17:42.652
Aren't you?

17:42.652 --> 17:44.062
I-I'm not.

17:44.192 --> 17:45.072
I'm not.

17:45.862 --> 17:49.532
I sometimes think that maybe I should have gone with him.

17:50.202 --> 17:54.032
Then I wouldn't think that I should have to test myself.

17:54.582 --> 17:56.372
Test yourself?

17:56.372 --> 17:57.082
Yup.

17:57.622 --> 18:02.422
Testing if I can like someone else or not.

18:02.422 --> 18:03.632
Does that mean...

18:04.172 --> 18:08.422
Honestly, I like you a lot.

18:10.302 --> 18:16.142
You're kind, talented, and cute.

18:16.142 --> 18:19.772
You're slow sometimes, but that really tickles my maternal instinct.

18:19.772 --> 18:22.232
I think you're really good.

18:22.982 --> 18:24.772
So that's why I tested myself.

18:25.442 --> 18:29.492
I would dump him and switch to you...

18:29.492 --> 18:31.452
...if I was too weak.

18:33.032 --> 18:34.822
But it didn't work.

18:35.702 --> 18:41.292
It was fun today, and I saw many good sides of you.

18:41.292 --> 18:44.832
But I still couldn't forget about him.

18:45.542 --> 18:50.842
We're so far apart, and we haven't seen each other in a long time.

18:51.722 --> 18:55.092
But everywhere we went,

18:55.682 --> 18:58.682
memories of him came back.

18:59.522 --> 19:00.682
So, I'm sorry.

19:00.682 --> 19:05.902
I dragged you around all day, and used you without asking you how you felt about it.

19:06.522 --> 19:07.942
I'm really sorry!

19:07.942 --> 19:11.362
You can hit me or do whatever you want now!

19:28.922 --> 19:31.092
It's really okay.

19:31.092 --> 19:33.222
I had fun too.

19:33.512 --> 19:34.972
Uh, but...

19:34.972 --> 19:37.392
I saw a movie for free, ate for free,

19:37.392 --> 19:39.142
and I was useful to someone else.

19:39.142 --> 19:40.852
That's the best day I could have had.

19:41.432 --> 19:45.602
Besides, I had a date with a pretty girl like you.

19:46.102 --> 19:49.652
Rather than being mad, I need to pay you back.

19:50.402 --> 19:52.402
All right, well said!

19:52.402 --> 19:56.112
Then I'll take that payment right now!

19:56.412 --> 19:59.952
For starters, you must attend tonight's party!

19:59.952 --> 20:01.122
My homework...

20:01.122 --> 20:01.702
Remember that!
My homework...

20:01.702 --> 20:02.582
Remember that!

20:10.882 --> 20:12.922
We're home, Kozue-chan!

20:12.922 --> 20:13.922
We're home.

20:14.422 --> 20:15.912
Welcome home.

20:15.912 --> 20:16.932
Momono-san.

20:17.632 --> 20:19.092
That's...

20:25.182 --> 20:26.982
Thank you, Kozue-chan.

20:26.982 --> 20:28.352
You're welcome.

20:31.652 --> 20:33.982
Kozue-chan, I bought some souvenirs.

20:33.982 --> 20:34.692
Souvenirs?

20:35.032 --> 20:35.822
Tada.

20:35.822 --> 20:38.452
Revenge from yesterday, taiyaki!

20:39.912 --> 20:41.282
What's the matter?

20:41.282 --> 20:43.452
I bought some, too.

20:43.792 --> 20:45.832
Oh, I see...

20:50.672 --> 20:52.092
Mom!

21:03.472 --> 21:05.772
I really don't understand, but...

21:06.482 --> 21:10.442
It's really like the calm after a storm.

21:13.022 --> 21:15.572
Why do you make me feel this way?

21:16.862 --> 21:21.072
I guess I really do belong to you.

21:22.572 --> 21:24.542
Momono-san!

21:25.042 --> 21:25.992
All right!

21:25.992 --> 21:28.372
We'll drink until morning!

21:32.752 --> 21:37.302
Will I be able to be as affectionate as Momono-san?

21:40.052 --> 21:40.932
All right!

21:40.932 --> 21:42.512
Next up is Shiratori-kun!

21:42.512 --> 21:44.932
But I have homework!

21:44.932 --> 21:46.852
What?!

21:46.852 --> 21:50.192
Can't you accept my offer?!

21:59.502 --> 22:06.012
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:06.092 --> 22:11.812
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:13.232 --> 22:19.692
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:19.942 --> 22:24.992
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:26.952 --> 22:33.702
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:33.952 --> 22:39.632
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:40.632 --> 22:46.472
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:46.472 --> 22:48.722
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:48.932 --> 22:55.102
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:55.602 --> 23:01.442
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

23:01.442 --> 23:06.072
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

23:22.062 --> 23:23.562
He's so...
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:23.562 --> 23:25.852
How long are you going to act like that?
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:25.852 --> 23:26.652
All right!
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:26.652 --> 23:30.732
I'm going to let this feeling out next week!
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:30.732 --> 23:32.032
Next Mahoraba - Summer! Swimsuits! The Beach!
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:32.032 --> 23:34.952
Summer! Swimsuits! The beach!
Next Mahoraba - Summer! Swimsuits! The Beach!

23:34.952 --> 23:37.022
Such a straightforward title.
Summer! Swimsuits! The beach!
